title: "Spatial Displacement Theory"
abstract: >-
  A zero-free-parameter physics framework. Space is a superfluidic hypercrystal;
  matter displaces it; every force is a pressure difference. The external input
  set is five members, of which one is an irreducible dimensional seed.
